#: apps/accounts/management/commands/telegram_notifications.py
msgid ""
"Masalani kodlashdan oldin kirish va chiqish formatini o‘qing. Kichik misolni"
" qo‘lda yechib, algoritm nima qilishi kerakligini aniqlang."
msgstr ""
"Read the input and output format before coding. Solve a small example by "
"hand to work out what the algorithm must do."

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/telegram_notifications.py
msgid ""
"Chekka holatlarni tekshiring: n=1, eng kichik qiymatlar, takroriy sonlar va "
"javob chegaralari ko‘p xatolarni topadi."
msgstr ""
"Check the edge cases: n=1, the smallest values, repeated numbers and answer "
"limits catch many mistakes."

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/telegram_notifications.py
msgid ""
"Murakkablikni baholang: n 10⁵ bo‘lsa, O(n²) algoritm odatda sekinlik qiladi."
" Avval yechimning vaqt va xotira sarfini hisoblang."
msgstr ""
"Estimate the complexity: if n is 10⁵, an O(n²) algorithm is usually too "
"slow. First work out the solution's time and memory use."

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/telegram_notifications.py
msgid ""
"Katta yechimdan oldin kichik brute-force yozib ko‘ring. Tasodifiy kichik "
"testlarda tez algoritm bilan solishtirish xatolarni topishga yordam beradi."
msgstr ""
"Write a small brute force before the big solution. Comparing it with the "
"fast algorithm on random small tests helps find mistakes."

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/telegram_notifications.py
msgid ""
"Xato javob chiqsa, bir o‘zgarishni tekshiring: oraliq qiymatlar, sikl "
"chegarasi va indekslar. Debug chiqarishlarini yakuniy javobdan olib "
"tashlang."
msgstr ""
"If the answer is wrong, check one change at a time: intermediate values, "
"loop bounds and indices. Remove debug output from the final answer."

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/telegram_notifications.py
msgid ""
"Yechimni topshirishdan oldin namunadan tashqari o‘zingiz tuzgan kamida bitta"
" testda ham sinang."
msgstr ""
"Before submitting, test it on at least one test of your own besides the "
"sample."

#: apps/accounts/management/commands/telegram_notifications.py
msgid ""
"Masalani yechgach, boshqa yechimni o‘qing va o‘zingiznikiga solishtiring. "
"Yangi g‘oyani keyingi masalada qo‘llab ko‘ring."
msgstr ""
"After solving, read another solution and compare it with yours. Try the new "
"idea on the next problem."

