#: templates/accounts/honor.html templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Halollik qoidalari"
msgstr "Honor code"

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid ""
"CodeArena halollik qoidalari: nima mumkin, nima mumkin emas, nima kuzatiladi"
" va qoidabuzarlik oqibati."
msgstr ""
"The CodeArena honor code: what is allowed, what is not, what is monitored, "
"and the consequences of breaking the rules."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid ""
"CodeArena'dagi har bir ball va har bir o‘rin — egasining o‘z mehnati. Shu "
"qoidalar buni kafolatlaydi."
msgstr ""
"Every point and every rank on CodeArena is its owner's own work. These rules"
" guarantee that."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Mumkin"
msgstr "Allowed"

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Dars materiallari, kitob, dasturlash tilining hujjatlari (docs)."
msgstr ""
"Course materials, books, the programming language's documentation (docs)."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Sintaksisni qidirish: «Pythonda ro‘yxat qanday saralanadi?»"
msgstr "Looking up syntax: “How do I sort a list in Python?”"

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Masaladagi maslahatlar (hint) — ular ballning bir qismini oladi."
msgstr "Hints on a problem — they take a part of the points."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "O‘qituvchidan yoki do‘stdan <b>g‘oyani</b> so‘rash (kodni emas)."
msgstr "Asking a teacher or a friend for the <b>idea</b> (not the code)."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "AI'dan mavzuni tushuntirib berishni so‘rash — masalaning o‘zini emas."
msgstr "Asking an AI to explain a topic — not the problem itself."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid ""
"O‘rta va qiyin masalalarda kodni o‘z muharriringizda yozib, keyin qo‘yish."
msgstr ""
"On medium and hard problems, writing code in your own editor and then "
"pasting it."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Mumkin emas"
msgstr "Not allowed"

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid ""
"Masala shartini AI'ga (ChatGPT, Gemini, Copilot va boshqalar) berib, kod "
"yozdirish."
msgstr ""
"Giving the problem statement to an AI (ChatGPT, Gemini, Copilot and others) "
"to have it write the code."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid ""
"Boshqa odamning yoki internetdagi tayyor yechimni ko‘chirish, «biroz "
"o‘zgartirib» bo‘lsa ham."
msgstr ""
"Copying someone else's or an online ready-made solution, even if you “change"
" it a little”."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "O‘z yechimingizni boshqalarga berish."
msgstr "Giving your own solution to others."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Birovning akkauntidan yoki birov bilan bitta akkauntdan ishlash."
msgstr ""
"Working from someone else's account or from one account with someone else."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid ""
"Musobaqada: har qanday tashqi yordam — AI, boshqa oyna, telefon, "
"maslahatchi."
msgstr ""
"In a contest: any outside help — AI, another window, a phone, an adviser."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Nima kuzatiladi"
msgstr "What is monitored"

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid ""
"Mashq va musobaqada muharrir kod qanday yozilganini qayd etadi: uzun kod "
"qo‘yish, boshqa oynaga o‘tish, kodning har 10 soniyadagi holati. Server "
"qabul qilingan kodni shu yozuvlar bilan solishtiradi, talabalar yechimlarini"
" bir-biri bilan ham solishtiradi. Bularni hakamlar va adminlar ko‘radi, "
"boshqa hech kim emas."
msgstr ""
"In practice and in contests, the editor records how the code was written: "
"pasting long code, switching to another window, the state of the code every "
"10 seconds. The server compares the accepted code with these records, and "
"also compares students' solutions with each other. Judges and admins see "
"them, nobody else."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Oqibati"
msgstr "Consequences"

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid ""
"<b class=\"text-ink\">Mashqda</b> — ko‘chirilgan deb topilgan yechim uchun "
"amaliyot bali berilmaydi."
msgstr ""
"<b class=\"text-ink\">In practice</b> — no practice points are given for a "
"solution found to be copied."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid ""
"<b class=\"text-ink\">Musobaqada, bitta masalada</b> — o‘sha masala natijasi"
" bekor qilinadi: unga ball berilmaydi, qolgan masalalaringiz natijasi "
"saqlanadi."
msgstr ""
"<b class=\"text-ink\">In a contest, on one problem</b> — that problem's "
"result is voided: no points for it, the results of your other problems stay."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid ""
"<b class=\"text-ink\">Bir nechta masalada</b>, birovning o‘rniga ishlash "
"yoki bitta qurilmada ikki kishi qatnashsa — diskvalifikatsiya: natija oxirgi"
" o‘ringa tushadi, reyting pasayadi."
msgstr ""
"<b class=\"text-ink\">On several problems</b>, working in someone else's "
"place, or two people on one device — disqualification: the result drops to "
"last place and the rating goes down."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "<b class=\"text-ink\">Takrorlansa</b> — hisob bloklanishi mumkin."
msgstr "<b class=\"text-ink\">If repeated</b> — the account may be blocked."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Adolat"
msgstr "Fairness"

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid ""
"Tizim hech kimni o‘zi jazolamaydi: belgilar faqat shubha. Qarorni admin yoki"
" hakam kodni ko‘rib chiqib qabul qiladi. E’tirozingiz bo‘lsa, musobaqa "
"tugaganidan keyin 48 soat ichida unga murojaat qiling: qaror bekor qilinishi"
" mumkin."
msgstr ""
"The system punishes nobody by itself: the flags are only suspicion. An admin"
" or a judge decides after reviewing the code. If you object, appeal within "
"48 hours after the contest ends: the decision may be reversed."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Men yechimlarimni o‘zim yozaman va bu qoidalarga amal qilaman."
msgstr "I write my solutions myself and will follow these rules."

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Qabul qilaman"
msgstr "I accept"

#: templates/accounts/honor.html
msgid "Siz bu qoidalarni %(user_honor_pledged_at)s da qabul qilgansiz."
msgstr "You accepted these rules on %(user_honor_pledged_at)s."

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid "Reyting qanday ishlaydi"
msgstr "How the rating works"

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid ""
"CodeArena'da musobaqa reytingi, amaliyot balli, duel reytingi va nishonlar "
"qanday hisoblanadi."
msgstr ""
"How the contest rating, practice points, duel rating and badges are "
"calculated on CodeArena."

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid ""
"CodeArena'da uch xil raqam bor. Ularning har biri o‘z ishi uchun va bir-"
"biriga ta’sir qilmaydi."
msgstr ""
"There are three kinds of numbers on CodeArena. Each is for its own purpose "
"and they do not affect one another."

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid ""
"Reytingli musobaqadan keyin o‘zgaradi: o‘rningiz o‘z darajangizdagi "
"o‘yinchilardan kutilganidan yaxshi bo‘lsa, ko‘tariladi, yomon bo‘lsa, "
"tushadi (Codeforces/Elo usuli). Birinchi 6 ta musobaqada yangilarga "
"qo‘shimcha «ramp» beriladi. Bu raqam jadvaldagi o‘rin va darajani "
"belgilaydi."
msgstr ""
"It changes after a rated contest: if your rank is better than expected from "
"players of your level, it goes up; if worse, it goes down (the "
"Codeforces/Elo method). In your first 6 contests, newcomers get an extra "
"“ramp”. This number sets your rank in the table and your level."

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid ""
"Reyting faqat <b>reytingli</b> raundlarda o‘zgaradi: «Mashq» raundlari "
"ta’sir qilmaydi."
msgstr ""
"The rating changes only in <b>rated</b> rounds: “Practice” rounds don't "
"affect it."

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid ""
"Hech narsa yubormagan ishtirokchi «qatnashmagan» hisoblanadi va reytingi "
"o‘zgarmaydi."
msgstr ""
"A participant who submitted nothing counts as “absent” and their rating "
"doesn't change."

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid ""
"Emailingiz tasdiqlanmagan bo‘lsa, raundga yozila olasiz, lekin reytingga "
"hisoblanmaysiz."
msgstr ""
"If your email is unconfirmed, you can sign up for a round, but you won't "
"count in the rating."

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid ""
"So‘nggi 90 kunda reytingli musobaqada qatnashmagan odam jadvaldan "
"yashiriladi; reytingi saqlanadi va yangi raunddan keyin qaytadi."
msgstr ""
"Someone who hasn't taken part in a rated contest in the last 90 days is "
"hidden from the table; their rating is kept and returns after a new round."

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid ""
"Diskvalifikatsiya qilingan ishtirokchi oxirgi o‘ringa tushadi, reyting faqat"
" pasayadi. Bunday qaror kech chiqsa, shu raunddan keyingi raundlar ham qayta"
" hisoblanadi."
msgstr ""
"A disqualified participant drops to last place and their rating only goes "
"down. If such a decision comes late, the rounds after this one are "
"recalculated too."

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid ""
"Faqat sizga ko‘rinadigan shaxsiy hisob (jadvalda o‘rin yo‘q): masala "
"yechganingiz uchun beriladi, qiyinroq va kamroq odam yechgan masala ko‘proq "
"ball beradi. Ball masala yechilgan paytdagi narxda <b>muzlatiladi</b>: keyin"
" boshqalar yechgani yoki xato qilgani sizning ballingizni o‘zgartirmaydi. "
"Faqat birinchi mos qabul qilingan yechim hisoblanadi. Musobaqa masalalari "
"raund e’lon qilingandan keyin hisobga o‘tadi. Ko‘chirilgan deb topilgan "
"yechimga ball berilmaydi."
msgstr ""
"A private score only you can see (no rank in a table): it is given for "
"solving problems, and a harder problem that fewer people solved gives more "
"points. Points are <b>frozen</b> at the price on the day the problem was "
"solved: later solves or mistakes by others don't change your points. Only "
"the first matching accepted solution counts. Contest problems count after "
"the round is published. No points are given for a solution found to be "
"copied."

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid ""
"Faqat 1 ga 1 duellar uchun (hamma 1200 dan boshlaydi) va musobaqa reytingiga"
" ta’sir qilmaydi. Bir juftlik kuniga cheklangan miqdorda duel o‘ynashi "
"mumkin; raqib deyarli o‘ynamagan duel g‘alaba sifatida nishon va kunlik "
"vazifaga sanalmaydi."
msgstr ""
"Only for 1 vs 1 duels (everyone starts at 1200), and it doesn't affect the "
"contest rating. A pair can play a limited number of duels a day; a duel "
"where the opponent hardly played doesn't count as a win for badges and the "
"daily task."

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid "Halollik va apellyatsiya"
msgstr "Honesty and appeals"

#: templates/accounts/how_ratings.html
msgid ""
"Tizim hech kimni o‘zi jazolamaydi: belgilar faqat shubha, qarorni admin "
"kodni ko‘rib chiqib qabul qiladi. Qaror noto‘g‘ri deb hisoblasangiz, "
"musobaqa sahifasidagi «Apellyatsiya» orqali yozing: javob "
"bildirishnomangizda chiqadi."
msgstr ""
"The system punishes nobody by itself: the flags are only suspicion, an admin"
" decides after reviewing the code. If you think a decision is wrong, write "
"through “Appeal” on the contest page: the reply appears in your "
"notifications."

